                <ul><li><a href='http://calcareers.ca.gov/CalHrPublic/Jobs/JobApplicationPackageChecklist.aspx?JobControlId=456441'>Job Application Package Checklist</a></li><li><a href='https://www.CalCareers.ca.gov/CalHrPublic/FileDownload.aspx?aid=25516097&name=LT_PO-199_542-061-1670-904.pdf'>Duty Statement</a></li></ul>

            </div>

        </div>

